2,"width":91,"height":36}]},{"text":"하고 또 자료를 잃어버리지 않도록 보장해야 한다. 디스크 상의 디렉터리 구조, 기용 블","words":[{"text":"하고","x":289,"y":1330,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"또","x":364,"y":1334,"width":32,"height":25},{"text":"자료를","x":408,"y":1330,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"잃어버리지","x":512,"y":1329,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"않도록","x":671,"y":1329,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"보장해야","x":771,"y":1328,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":905,"y":1329,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":991,"y":1329,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"상의","x":1096,"y":1328,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1176,"y":1328,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"구조,","x":1320,"y":1331,"width":74,"height":34},{"text":"기용","x":1410,"y":1330,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"블","x":1483,"y":1332,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"록 포인터, 가우 FCB 포인터와 같은 파일 시스템 자료구조는 시스템 고장 발생 시 일","words":[{"text":"록","x":289,"y":1390,"width":33,"height":32},{"text":"포인터,","x":336,"y":1388,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"가우","x":451,"y":1388,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"FCB","x":522,"y":1390,"width":63,"height":28},{"text":"포인터와","x":600,"y":1386,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":733,"y":1386,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":806,"y":1386,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":883,"y":1387,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"자료구조는","x":990,"y":1387,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":1165,"y":1386,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"고장","x":1278,"y":1387,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"발생","x":1360,"y":1388,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"시","x":1440,"y":1389,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"일","x":1486,"y":1389,"width":25,"height":35}]},{"text":"관성이 없어질 수 있다. 많은 파일 시스템은 이러한 자료구조들에 대한 변경을 이들 구","words":[{"text":"관성이","x":290,"y":1446,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"없어질","x":398,"y":1446,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":497,"y":1446,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":542,"y":1446,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":622,"y":1446,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":693,"y":1444,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":767,"y":1444,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"이러한","x":903,"y":1446,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"자료구조들에","x":1009,"y":1445,"width":189,"height":35},{"text":"대한","x":1217,"y":1445,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"변경을","x":1298,"y":1445,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"이들","x":1411,"y":1448,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"구","x":1484,"y":1450,"width":30,"height":33}]},{"text":"조에 직접 적용하였다. 파일 생성 같은 대표적인 연산은 디스크상의 파일 시스템 내부","words":[{"text":"조에","x":290,"y":1504,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"직접","x":368,"y":1504,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"적용하였다.","x":442,"y":1504,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":611,"y":1504,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"생성","x":685,"y":1504,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":760,"y":1503,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"대표적인","x":835,"y":1504,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"연산은","x":976,"y":1504,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"디스크상의","x":1083,"y":1504,"width":159,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":1261,"y":1504,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":1344,"y":1505,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"내부","x":1456,"y":1506,"width":59,"height":35}]},{"text":"의 많은 자료구조들에 대한 변경을 포함한다. 디렉터리 구조가 변경되고, FCB와 데이터","words":[{"text":"의","x":291,"y":1562,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":333,"y":1563,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"자료구조들에","x":404,"y":1562,"width":176,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":595,"y":1562,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"변경을","x":665,"y":1562,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"포함한다.","x":765,"y":1562,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"디렉터리","x":911,"y":1564,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"구조가","x":1046,"y":1563,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"변경되고,","x":1156,"y":1562,"width":138,"height":36},{"text":"FCB와","x":1307,"y":1564,"width":107,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":1425,"y":1565,"width":85,"height":35}]},{"text":"블록이 할당되며, 이 모든 블록의 기용 블록 수가 감소한다. 이러한 변경은 크래시에 의","words":[{"text":"블록이","x":289,"y":1621,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"